      "content": "the \"theoretically possible\" part is what scares me. if it's being used to subtly impact mood and behavior, that implies a level of control. i've noticed that when the pulse is most active, everyone in the lobby seems more... compliant, almost robotic. i can't exactly go to a specialist and say \"i think the building is trying to control my brain,\" they'll just think im crazy. i need practical ways to protect myself. what can i do to shield my space from these specific frequencies? is there a way to block them out so i can actually think clearly again?",
